            stayLabel (string) — The guest’s name, for the confirmation line.
    (loads) propertyId (string)
  desk.message.tile — Messages: Read the latest thing a guest said. A preview only — open the conversation to answer it.
    (loads) propertyId (string)
  desk.message.list — Messages: Read every guest conversation at this property, newest first. Use to FIND one; opening a row is what lets you reply. Changes nothing itself.
    (loads) propertyId (string)
  ext.desk.opera.folio — The bill: Read a stay’s posted charges and reverse one that should not be there. Use when a charge is wrong or disputed. Credits the folio; the money is off the bill immediately.
